<title>USA: Rexel CEO Alain Viry to leave company.</title>
<headline>Rexel CEO Alain Viry to leave company.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rexel Inc said its chief executive Alain Viry will be leaving the company to assume the role of CEO of Paris-based CFAO, the international trading unit of Pinault-Printemps-Redoute.</p>
<p>Rexel said Rexel SA managing director Gilles Guinchard will be proposed to succeed Viry at Rexel's board of directors meeting on March 14.</p>
<p>The company said the change is expected to become effective on April 14.</p>
</text>
